    "table_description": "Scan processing workflow records for archaeological data processing. Grain: one row = one processing workflow execution. Key columns: flowregistry (PK, workflow ID), flowsoft (processing software: Agisoft, CloudCompare, Geomagic, RealityCapture), flowstage (processing stage: Raw, Aligned, Meshed, Textured, Final), flowhrs (processing hours, REAL, range 0.5-47.9), proccpu (CPU usage percentage, INTEGER, range 50-100), procgpu (GPU usage percentage, INTEGER, range 50-100), remaingb (remaining storage GB, REAL, range 1.1-999.8), memusagegb (memory usage GB, REAL, range 1.3-126.2), zoneref (FK→sites.zoneregistry, join key to scans table), equipref (FK→equipment.equipregistry). Join pattern: scanprocessing→scans on zoneref, then scans→scanpointcloud on arcref only (not crewref — intentional fanout matching the accepted pattern for this database family). Total rows: 1000. Filters for metric computation: flowhrs > 0 AND (proccpu + procgpu) > 0 ensures valid PER computation.",
